      "rawSource": "(Extracted from full RTF)",
      "cleanSource": "\u0026SecurityPolicies = GAMRepository.GetSecurityPolicies(\u0026Filter, \u0026Errors)\n\t\u0026RoleSecurityPolicyId.AddItem(0,\u0022WWP_GAM_None\u0022)\n\t\n\tFor \u0026SecurityPolicy in \u0026SecurityPolicies\n\t\t\u0026RoleSecurityPolicyId.AddItem(\u0026SecurityPolicy.Id,\u0026SecurityPolicy.Name)\n\tEndFor\n\tIf \u0026Mode \u003C\u003E GAMAPiMode.Insert\n\t\t\u0026Role.Load(\u0026Id)\n\t\t\u0026RoleId = \u0026Role.Id\n\t\t\u0026RoleGUID = \u0026Role.GUID\n\t\t\u0026RoleName = \u0026Role.Name\n\t\t\u0026RoleDescription = \u0026Role.Description\n\t\t\u0026RoleExternalId = \u0026Role.ExternalId\n\t\t\u0026RoleSecurityPolicyId = \u0026Role.SecurityPolicyId\n\tEndif\n\tIf \u0026Mode = TrnMode.Display\n\t\tBtnEnter.Visible = False\n\tEndif\n\tIf \u0026Mode = TrnMode.Display or \u0026Mode = TrnMode.Delete\n\t\t\u0026RoleSecurityPolicyId.Enabled = False\n\t\t\u0026RoleName.Enabled = False\n\t\t\u0026RoleDescription.Enabled = False\n\t\t\u0026RoleExternalId.Enabled = False\n\t\tIf \u0026Mode = TrnMode.Delete\n\t\t\tBtnEnter.Caption = \u0022Delete\u0022\n\t\tendif\n\tEndif\n\t\u0026Role.Id\t= \u0026Id\n\t/* Generated by DVelop Work With Plus Pattern [Start] - Do not change */\n\t/* Generated by DVelop Work With Plus Pattern [End] - Do not change */"
    },
    {
      "blockName": "Enter",
      "blockType": "Event",
      "rawSource": "(Extracted from full RTF)",
      "cleanSource": "\u0026Role.Load(\u0026Id)\n\tDo Case\n\t\tCase \u0026Mode = GAMAPiMode.Insert or \u0026Mode = GAMAPiMode.Update\n\t\t\t\u0026Role.Name = \u0026RoleName\n\t\t\t\u0026Role.Description = \u0026RoleDescription\n\t\t\t\u0026Role.ExternalId = \u0026RoleExternalId\n\t\t\t\u0026Role.SecurityPolicyId = \u0026RoleSecurityPolicyId\n\t\t\t\u0026Role.Save()\n\t\tCase \u0026Mode = GAMAPiMode.Delete\n\t\t\t\u0026Role.Delete()\n\tEndCase\n\tIf \u0026Role.Success()\n\t\tCommit\n\t\treturn\n\tElse\n\t\t\u0026Errors = \u0026Role.GetErrors()\n\t\tFor \u0026Error in \u0026Errors\n\t\t\tMsg(Format(!\u0022%1 (GAM%2)\u0022, \u0026Error.Message, \u0026Error.Code))\n\t\tEndFor\n\tEndif"
